[00:14.14]1. Sarah and Esther, Mary, Ruth, and others—
[00:22.10]All these were capable women, loyal wives.
[00:30.26]Godly devotion was foremost in their lives.
[00:37.60]They were faithful women, ones we know by name.
[00:45.72]There were others favored by Jehovah;
[00:49.88]Nameless in the record, their faith was just the same.
[00:58.92]2. Goodness and courage, loyal love and kindness—
[01:06.14]Lovable qualities in all humankind,
[01:14.22]Virtues these excellent women bring to mind.
[01:22.34]They were fine examples we appreciate.
[01:30.44]In the same way now our Christian sisters
[01:34.56]Show a faithful spirit we all can imitate.
[01:47.50]3. Mothers and daughters, sisters, wives, and widows,
[01:54.50]Willingly laboring, glad to do your part.
[02:03.90]Modest your bearing, submissive is your heart,
[02:11.40]Having God’s approval, may you never fear.
[02:19.48]Christian sisters, may Jehovah keep you
[02:23.62]Firm in your conviction, your prize is drawing near.
